    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021-2022 Targets:

- Establishment of (3) Community-based Conflict Resolution Mechanisms.
- Conduct (3) Conflict Monitor Trainings.
- Conduct (2) Alternative Dispute Resolution Trainings.
- Execute (9) Community Dialogue Sessions.
- Execute (9) Peace Building Awareness Raising Sessions.
- Support (40) livelihoods opportunities for men and women.
- Conduct (2) micro-finance management trainings.
- Rehabilitation of (2) water yards.
- Conduct (2) Water User Committees Trainings.
- Establishment and support to (4) local peace initiatives.
- Conduct Peace Building: Concepts and Principles Training.
- Conduct (2) Gender Equality/ GBV Trainings for young women and youth.
- Conduct (6) young women and youth peace building sessions.
- Conduct (3) Localized training sessions.
- Execute (1) Peace festival (celebration of International Peace Day).
- Perform advocacy and exchange visits at locality and state levels.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
